    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Welcome to the Rust Forge!",
      "source_hash": 2221464082089535220,
      "context_hash": 3088037172512721912,
      "translation": "Rust Forge에 오신 것을 환영합니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:20:05.227447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Rust Forge serves as a repository of supplementary documentation useful for members of [The Rust Programming Language].",
      "source_hash": 18346087055671360928,
      "context_hash": 14678870841865362915,
      "translation": "Rust Forge는 [The Rust Programming Language] 구성원에게 유용한 보충 문서 저장소 역할을 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:20:05.227447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "If you find any mistakes, typos, or want to add to the Rust Forge, feel free to file an issue or PR [on GitHub].",
      "source_hash": 13309419593639666538,
      "context_hash": 12429445550796092876,
      "translation": "오류나 오타를 발견하셨거나 Rust Forge에 내용을 추가하고 싶으시면 [on GitHub]에서 자유롭게 이슈나 PR을 제출해 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust",
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:20:05.227447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Help Wanted",
      "source_hash": 4456158525521273683,
      "context_hash": 2064022178245624849,
      "translation": "도움이 필요합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.216473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
